have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker52","name":"Luvaralelo Statue","legend":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠗\udc35\udc26\udc16\ud802𐠭\udc30\udc21𐠡𐠲\udc02\udc16\ud802𐠨\udc12\udc1d𐠄𐠋𐠠\udc04\udc11\ud802 \udc22\ud802\ud802𐠚\udc1b\udc08\udc19𐠨𐠔\udc02</div>"},{"id":"marker53","name":"Cornariapur Column","legend":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802 \udc1c𐠂\ud802𐠕\ud802 \udc27\udc29\udc29\udc03\udc01\udc2f\udc13\udc28\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠎\udc0e\udc22\ud802𐠡\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠝\udc38𐠠\ud802𐠓\udc05\udc22 \ud802𐠞\udc13𐠃\udc12𐠪𐠐\udc2a\udc33𐠣\udc35\udc2f\udc13𐠷\udc2f\udc0f𐠁\ud802 𐠯\ud802</div>"},{"id":"marker54","name":"Bayejan Monument","legend":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">በ አዐጰጸፀወ ደከፐአነጰጸፀ ሀፈ ኀዘዐፐፀጸሀየጠወሀሐሠ አዐአረከደሰጰ ዐአዐ ኀ በቀዘዐፐገኀረየሰነ ተዐ ዐፀዐ አኀቀኀተበተፀወሰለሐሐፈሰሠገበ</div>"},{"id":"marker55","name":"Dubristodu Stele","legend":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠻᡯᠳᢂᡯᡙᡲ᠐ᢞᡑᡕᡭᠼᠩᡎᢐᢜᠮᡞᡟᡝᢥᠳᢒ᠒ᢀᡆᡭᢏᠽᡐᠲᡀᡟᢀᢟᡙᢐᢦᡑᡠᢜᢀ᠒ᡒᡗᡟᠿᠽᢦᡁᡗᠩᡏᡝᠪᢀᠱᠭᢡᡓᡳᡓᢤᠧᠡᡙᡡᠨᢠᡑᡏᡰ</div>"},{"id":"marker56","name":"Perscom Monolith","legend":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">𐠼\udc37𐠮\ud802𐠱𐠨\udc03\udc1d\udc21\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠭𐠷\udc1b\udc37\udc08\udc26\udc16\ud802𐠴𐠳\udc20\udc2b\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠜\udc32\udc15</div>"},{"id":"marker57","name":"Linnavobun Monolith","legend":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༁༃༦༕༓༭༡༊༜༭༻༱་༁༱༓༶༈༐༖༉༕༊༒༆༌༂༂༄༊༬༧༐༉༒༻༽༺༘༔༶༙༕་ༀ༴༳༯༴༗༴༰༙༫༆༯༑༈༼༜༑༓༛༼༷༿༬༁༾༖༳༧༴༴༌༄</div>"},{"id":"marker58","name":"Castrix Obelisk","legend":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\"> ተጰረመዘወከኀቀ መመከፐሠለነሀ ዐአዘነሐሀከየ ኀኀፀዘአገበ ዐጠዘ ሰበደሐበለፐ አዘጠተፀተጸ </div>"},{"id":"marker59","name":"Mocortis Sculpture","legend":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༱༙༨༼༬༇༄༒༜༓༻༲༪༴༖༿ༀ༦་༣༦༪༷༵༥༶༡༤༽༣༓༧༯༫༑ༀ༜༰༤༙༭༜༉༱༅</div>"},{"id":"marker60","name":"Dubrinagus Megalith","legend":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༓༩ༀ༂༵༯༶༁༭༓༑༶༻༊༛༣༰༰༣༉༙༥༯༇༚༾༆༾༺༛༣༒༓༔༗༶༈༪༰༘༡༱༑༻༧་༑༲༓༙༿༿༒༵༱༮༼༔༕ༀ༂༯༬༤༉༨༣༾༰༁༑༙༬༫༺༡༜༓༐་༙༠༗༖༪༴༜༛༲༼༒༄༉༃ༀ༇༺༇༮༉</div>"},{"id":"marker61","name":"Ruined Fort","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fort. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker62","name":"Ruined Fortress","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fortress. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker63","name":"Ruined Fort","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fort. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker64","name":"Ruined City","legend":"Ruins of an ancient city. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker65","name":"Ruined Sacred site","legend":"Ruins of an ancient sacred site. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker66","name":"Ruined Fortress","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fortress. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker67","name":"Ruined City","legend":"Ruins of an ancient city. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker68","name":"Ruined Settlement","legend":"Ruins of an ancient settlement. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker69","name":"Ruined Stronghold","legend":"Ruins of an ancient stronghold. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker70","name":"Etebodula Library","legend":"A vast collection of knowledge, including many rare and ancient tomes."},{"id":"mar